  "title": "Teri B NDE 6691",
  "date": "Oct 28 1974",
  "content": "I was in labor. After twelve hours my heart stopped. I remember watching them work on me from above. After I left my body, there was no pain. I went through a tunnel at high speed. It was wonderful there and I did not want to come back. I heard a male voice telling me I had to go home and that I was needed there. As fast as I was out of my body, I was back in to it. That's when I felt pain again. Since then, I have not been afraid of death because I know there is life after death.",
